      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Source & reference\nVideo is normalized to **24 fps**. `768` targets **1 MP**; `480` targets **0.5 MP**. Duration `0` uses the full clip.\nAnchor defaults to **(none)**. Upload an anchor to enable it automatically; select (none) again to disable."
      ],
