      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pinned models\nUse the exact **Ref2VA INT8 + FL2V Turbo 8-step + Character Swap V1** combination. Keep both LoRA strengths at 1.\nLinux + NVIDIA is the tested runtime. Model weights are downloaded separately. No LTXVideo extension is required.\n\n### Downloads\n[sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1/resolve/7bb8374780a725b4353ed31f3a9395c9742b5621/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors)\n\n[minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/e5eb578a89295337b8ff433a035929ce0279e0b6/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n[h3_character_swap_pro4500_1000.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/akatz-ai/MiniMax-H3-Character-Swap-LoRA/resolve/a665bb7e3bb9804e487d2925f67744f554c8ad49/h3_character_swap_pro4500_1000.safetensors)\n\n[minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Minimax-h3-Turbo/resolve/3ec17a324ced54151364f24f8b5fb6bf7e26414f/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n\n[qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/e5eb578a89295337b8ff433a035929ce0279e0b6/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n[minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/e5eb578a89295337b8ff433a035929ce0279e0b6/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n[minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/e5eb578a89295337b8ff433a035929ce0279e0b6/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
