      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SAM mask review\nText describes the target (usually `person`). Choose largest / leftmost / rightmost / index if several people appear.\nTracking follows one selected person. **64 px expansion** matches the app at 1 MP. Change the review frame index to inspect motion. Empty tracking frames use the app’s per-frame recovery. Unresolved frames stop generation.\nFor mask-only review, select the preview node and use ComfyUI’s partial execution. Keep the final generator out of that selection."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## SAM mask review\nText describes the target (usually `person`). Choose largest / leftmost / rightmost / index if several people appear.\nTracking follows one selected person. **64 px expansion** matches the app at 1 MP. Change the review frame index to inspect motion. Empty tracking frames use the app’s per-frame recovery. Unresolved frames stop generation.\nFor mask-only review, select the preview node and use ComfyUI’s partial execution. Keep the final generator out of that selection."
      },
      "color": "#24313b",
      "bgcolor": "#182129"
    },
