      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Generation\nReplace the starter text with specific character traits (face, skin, hair, outfit) and the source action. A generic swap instruction can retain source identity. Audio guide is **on** by default; it uses source audio for reference and frame-zero guidance. The saved MP4 always keeps the source soundtrack.\nDefault **8 steps / CFG 1 / er_sde / normal**, **124-frame windows / 18-frame history**. Continuations use H−1 source reference history.\n`use_mask` disables masked diffusion when false. The workspace estimate helps memory placement; it is not a VRAM cap."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Generation\nReplace the starter text with specific character traits (face, skin, hair, outfit) and the source action. A generic swap instruction can retain source identity. Audio guide is **on** by default; it uses source audio for reference and frame-zero guidance. The saved MP4 always keeps the source soundtrack.\nDefault **8 steps / CFG 1 / er_sde / normal**, **124-frame windows / 18-frame history**. Continuations use H−1 source reference history.\n`use_mask` disables masked diffusion when false. The workspace estimate helps memory placement; it is not a VRAM cap."
      },
      "color": "#24313b",
      "bgcolor": "#182129"
    },
